        <app loc="6" ana="#app.sic"><lem><hi rend="supraline">ⲙⲛ</hi>ϫⲱⲥ</lem><note>sic, unintelligible; no correction offered</note></app>
        <app loc="13" ana="#app.conjecture"><rdg resp="#edition"><supplied reason="lost">ⲡ</supplied>ⲁⲛⲉⲥ</rdg><note>for the beginning of the line, perhaps</note></app>
        <app loc="32" ana="#app.correction"><rdg resp="#edition">ⲛⲉϣ ⲛ<supplied reason="omitted">ⲛ</supplied>ⲉⲩ</rdg><note>read</note></app>
      </listApp>
      </div>
      <div type="commentary">
        <p n="1" ana="#tr.print">The framed manuscript page number [ⲓⲁ] is printed with a bar above and below as the frame, not as a supralinear stroke.</p>
        <p n="10" ana="#tr.bracket">The edition prints ⲡⲉⲧ[(ⲛ)ⲁ]: the ⲛ stands in parentheses inside the restoration. The parentheses cannot be encoded; the restoration is recorded as [ⲛⲁ].</p>
        <p n="11" ana="#tr.bracket">The bracket before the last eleven dots is not closed in the edition; it is closed here at the line end.</p>
        <p n="13" ana="#tr.print">The restored ⲣ in [ⲉⲣⲉ is printed with a sublinear dot.</p>
        <p n="25" ana="#tr.print">The ⲉ after the four dots is smudged in the scan; read as ⲉ.</p>
        <p n="35" ana="#tr.print">The stroke over the final ⲧ of ⲧⲛⲧⲁⲛⲧ is printed obliquely.</p>
      </div>
